UID:funcheap-20261010-fleetfest2026navybandsfo
CATEGORIES:community,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/fleet-fest-2026-navy-bands-food-trucks
 -fishermans-wharf/\nVenue: Fisherman’s Wharf – SkyStar Wheel and Pier 
 27 2860 Taylor St\, San Francisco\, CA\nPrice: Free\nCategories: community
 \, free\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nFleet Fest is a free community 
 festival at Fisherman’s Wharf in San Francisco\, celebrating the Nation
 ’s sea services as part of Fleet Week. The event features live performan
 ces by local musicians and military bands\, exhibitor booths from city org
 anizations and local businesses\, activities for families and children\, f
 ood trucks\, pop-up vendors\, and a beverage bar. The festival takes place
  at the SkyStar Wheel and Pier 27. Original Event Description: _Fleet Fest
  Date & Time Saturday\, October 10 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM Sunday\, October 11
  9:00 AM – 5:00 PM Location Fisherman’s Wharf – SkyStar Wheel and Pi
 er 27 2860 Taylor St\, San Francisco\, CA 94111 Info This event is free. D
 onate to Fleet Fest This celebration of our Nation’s sea services is a d
 ynamic festival right on the pier hosting the Navy’s Fleet Week flagship
 . Experience performances by local musicians and featured military bands. 
 Exhibitors include city organizations\, local businesses\, veteran and act
 ive duty support organizations\, educational experiences and fun activitie
 s for kids and parents alike. Grab a bite from our food truck lane and pop
 -up vendors. Visit our bar for a variety of beverages while our stage rock
 s all day long.
LOCATION:Fisherman’s Wharf – SkyStar Wheel and Pier 27 2860 Taylor St\
 , San Francisco\, CA
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/fleet-fest-2026-navy-bands-food-trucks-fisherm
 ans-wharf/
END:VEVENT
